WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.902
-Guys, whenever I get
some down time here at the show,

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.537
I like to go on Instagram and
scroll through all the photos.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.805
-Really?
-And one thing I've noticed

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.273
is that a lot of times,
two people

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.741
will write the exact same
caption,

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:11.243
but the pictures they post
will be completely different.

00:00:11.243 --> 00:00:12.479
-Oh, no.
-I'll show you --

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:14.914
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:17.183
Did he say "Oh, no?"
-Yeah.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.085
-I'll show you what I mean
in this next segment.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.786
It's time for "Picture This."
Here we go.

00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:24.023
-♪ Picture this, picture this,
picture this ♪

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:25.591
♪ Yeah, picture this ♪

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:28.361
-[ Laughs ] Having a small crowd
is so fun,

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.996
but it's also really personal.

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:33.533
I get to hear
every single person's opinion.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.801
Yeah.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:37.536
So I said there's the same
caption, different photos

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:39.205
and he said --
-Oh, no.

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.307
-Yeah. That's right.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:44.377
So, let's take a look
at this first example.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.345
It's from Tesla and Microsoft.

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:47.213
-Oh, no.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.548
-They both wrote...

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:53.185
Tesla posted a picture
of their new electric car.

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:54.987
Microsoft posted
a picture of...

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:56.956
Bill Gates.
Do you see what I'm saying?

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.090
You understand?

00:00:58.090 --> 00:00:59.792
-Same caption.
-Same caption.

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:00.926
Different post.

00:01:00.926 --> 00:01:02.095
The next one is from

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:04.597
President Obama
and President Biden.

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:05.632
They both wrote...

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.737
President Obama posted
a picture of...a UFO.

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:13.706
President Biden posted
a picture of...

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:14.907
an iPhone.

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:16.609
Where's my man?
Where's my man?

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.444
Can we cut to him?

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:20.313
Yeah, stand up.
Yeah, yeah, there he goes.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:21.614
This guy works --

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.483
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:27.419
♪♪

00:01:27.419 --> 00:01:29.789
We talked to him
before the show.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.825
He's representing -- He works
at the Apple Store,

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:37.262
and so any Apple humor,
you laugh doubly.

00:01:37.262 --> 00:01:38.664
-Right.
-Yeah.

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:40.432
What's your name?
-My name's David.

00:01:40.432 --> 00:01:43.236
-David, are you a Genius?

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:44.637
-Am I what?
-A Genius?

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:45.938
-I'm a specialist.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.240
-Mm.
-A specialist.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.842
-So wait --
-There's a hierarchy at Apple.

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:52.211
You start as a specialist,
go to an expert, then a Genius.

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.614
-Oh, so right now you're a
specialist, not yet an expert.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:56.182
-I just finished
my freshman year.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.516
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.516 --> 00:01:59.785
-Who are you pointing at?
-Over there?

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:01.821
Do we teach a course here?

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:03.856
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:06.058
What's your major?

00:02:06.058 --> 00:02:07.393
-I was a musical theater major.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:09.395
I went for musical theater
and opera

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:10.964
at the University of Montevallo.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.131
-Whoa!

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:14.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
Did you have a --

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.635
David, did you have
a go-to song?

00:02:16.635 --> 00:02:18.905
Did you have something that
you used to love to sing?

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:20.306
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.774
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.742
-Yeah, David!

00:02:23.742 --> 00:02:26.279
-David, I'll hold this
out to you.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.480
We've got to be six feet away.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.848
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:33.152
Don't mess around.
David, stay there. Stay there.

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:34.820
Yeah.
And I'll just hold this.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.856
It's for COVID reasons, I think.
But, okay.

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:38.258
David, what's your last name?

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:39.659
-Poehler, like Amy Poehler.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:40.759
-Yeah, oh, my God.
David Poehler.

00:02:40.759 --> 00:02:42.728
All right, great.
Here's David Poehler

00:02:42.728 --> 00:02:46.532
with his audition doing --

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:48.234
-"Tomorrow" from "Annie."

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.401
-Oh, my God.

00:02:49.401 --> 00:02:51.537
Wow.

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:53.272
Do we have time for that?

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:55.140
Oh, my God.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.543
Alright.

00:02:57.543 --> 00:03:01.648
-♪ The sun'll come out
tomorrow ♪

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:06.619
♪ Bet your bottom dollar
that tomorrow ♪

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:09.688
-♪ There'll be sun ♪

00:03:09.688 --> 00:03:10.823
-Let's go to the part.

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:13.993
-♪ Tomorrow, tomorrow ♪

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:17.296
-♪ I love ya tomorrow ♪

00:03:17.296 --> 00:03:21.333
♪ You're always a day ♪

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:25.737
♪ Awaaaaaaaaaa... ♪

00:03:25.737 --> 00:03:27.206
-That's how you do it!

00:03:27.206 --> 00:03:29.875
-♪ ...aaaaaaaaay ♪

00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:32.145
-David Poehler!

00:03:32.145 --> 00:03:33.980
That's how you do it
right there!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.882
Thank you very much.
Thank you for being here, buddy.

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:38.183
That was unbelievable.
Wow!

00:03:38.183 --> 00:03:39.785
Talented crowd!

00:03:39.785 --> 00:03:41.921
Thank you, Roots.

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:43.989
Oh, he's got pipes.

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:45.825
He's got pipes.

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.860
No wonder he's yelling
in the crowd.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.862
Yeah! He's gotta sing!

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.130
-He's gotta sing.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.199
-We're still doing -- Yeah.
-We got bits?

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:54.801
-We're still doing this bit.
Yeah, here we go.

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:55.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.901 --> 00:03:57.337
Check out this photo here.

00:03:57.337 --> 00:03:58.771
This next one's from
the Girl Scouts

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:00.306
and "Entertainment Weekly."

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:01.407
-Oh. Girl Scouts and
"Entertainment Weekly."

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:02.408
-They both wrote...

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:06.946
Girl Scouts posted
a picture of...a troop.

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:08.715
"Entertainment Weekly"
posted a picture of...

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:10.984
the cast of "Knives Out 2."

00:04:10.984 --> 00:04:13.452
I guess they just keep
adding people.

00:04:13.452 --> 00:04:16.522
This next one is from
J.Lo and Ben Affleck.

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:18.257
[ Audience ohs ]

00:04:18.257 --> 00:04:19.726
They both wrote...

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:23.329
J.Lo posted a picture of...

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:25.364
Ben Affleck.

00:04:25.364 --> 00:04:26.899
Ben Affleck posted
a picture of...

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:29.101
the CDC's current
mask guidelines.

00:04:29.101 --> 00:04:30.403
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:31.703
Wear them.
Don't wear them.

00:04:31.703 --> 00:04:33.539
Yes. I can? No. Can't.

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:35.341
Mask. Mask up.

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:38.377
Here's one from Guy Fieri
and "Politico."

00:04:38.377 --> 00:04:39.412
They both wrote...

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:45.651
Guy Fieri posted
a picture of...a rack of ribs.

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:47.186
"Politico"
posted a picture of...

00:04:47.186 --> 00:04:49.322
Mitch McConnell.
[ Audience ohs ]

00:04:49.322 --> 00:04:51.357
-Why would they do that?
-Why would they --

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:53.793
I would think that's offensive.
-That seems odd.

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:56.062
-That seems odd to me.
-That seems rude and mean.

00:04:56.062 --> 00:04:57.697
-All right. Here's the last one.

00:04:57.697 --> 00:05:00.833
It's from Bill de Blasio
and Andrew Yang.

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:01.868
They both wrote...

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:06.072
Bill de Blasio
posted a picture of...

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:08.407
unvaccinated New Yorkers
going maskless.

00:05:08.407 --> 00:05:10.009
Andrew Yang
posted a picture of...

00:05:10.009 --> 00:05:11.544
Bill de Blasio in Nets gear.

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:13.546
That's all the time we have
for "Picture This."

